# Retrieval eval (Day 11): private course files, the embedding cache and raw result JSON stay local;
# the corpus manifest (names + sha256) and the Markdown summaries are committed
backend/eval/corpus/*
!backend/eval/corpus/manifest.json
backend/eval/.cache/
backend/eval/results/*.json
# Real users' questions mined from the database, and generation by-products
backend/eval/datasets/hard_candidates.jsonl
backend/eval/datasets/*.progress.jsonl
# Generation drafts quote whole source chunks; only the frozen dataset (short quotes) is committed
backend/eval/datasets/*.draft.jsonl
backend/eval/datasets/*.review.md
# Generation eval (Day 12): the blind labelling sheet quotes the private corpus and the answers;
# only the labels file (ids + labels) is committed.
backend/eval/datasets/*.sheet.md

# Post screenshots: show demo account emails and would bloat history
docs/posts/assets/

# Binaries
*.exe

# Personal planning docs (build timelines)
f1_build_timeline.docx
rag_build_timeline.docx
f1_daily_command_sequence.pdf
rag_daily_command_sequence.pdf

# Personal learning notes (written by /run-day, local only)
docs/learning/

# Personal Claude Code settings (.claude/settings.json is shared and committed)
.claude/settings.local.json
